    "和他人比較後會湧上嫉妒、焦躁、自卑、喪失自信、驕傲自滿、優越感等情緒，結果反而常讓人無法進一步展開行動" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Comparing yourself with others stirs up envy, irritation, inferiority, lost confidence, smugness, superiority — and that usually stops you acting rather than helping"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "他人と比べると、嫉妬・焦り・劣等感・自信喪失・慢心・優越感などが湧き上がり、かえって行動できなくなることが多いのです"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
