    "寫下「現在不想做的三個理由」，幫助看見真正的行動煞車器。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write “three reasons I don’t want to do this now” — it reveals what’s really braking you."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「今やりたくない理由を3つ」書き出すと、本当のブレーキが見えてきます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寫下「現在不想做的三個理由」，幫助看見真正的行動煞車器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寫下一個「看起來很不現實」但讓自己很心動的目標。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write down one goal that looks unrealistic but genuinely excites you."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「非現実的に見えるけれど、心が動く」目標を一つ書き出しましょう。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寫下一個「看起來很不現實」但讓自己很心動的目標。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寫下一句：即使今天做不好，明天還是可以繼續。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write one line: even if today didn’t go well, tomorrow I can carry on."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一行書きましょう：今日うまくいかなくても、明日また続けられる。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寫下一句：即使今天做不好，明天還是可以繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寫下三件做得不錯的事，和一件想調整的事。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write three things that went well and one thing you’d adjust."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "うまくいったことを3つ、変えたいことを1つ書きましょう。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寫下三件做得不錯的事，和一件想調整的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寫下三種聲音：想做的我／害怕的我／別人眼中的期待。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write the three voices: the me who wants to, the me who’s afraid, and what others expect."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3つの声を書き出しましょう：やりたい自分／怖がっている自分／他人からの期待。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寫下三種聲音：想做的我／害怕的我／別人眼中的期待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "寫下今天「一定要做」的最多三件事，其它放到明天或之後。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write at most three must-dos for today; push the rest to tomorrow or later."
