    },
    "當自我肯定感低落時，有「低估自己理所當然能做到的事情」的傾向" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When self-esteem is low, we tend to undervalue the things we can obviously do"
