    "長期記錄可以幫助你發現自己的狀態模式。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Logging over time helps you spot the patterns in how you are."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
