    "開啟 iCloud 同步後，刪除 App 重新安裝也不會遺失資料" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With iCloud sync on, your data survives deleting and reinstalling the app"
