    "顏色深淺代表當天的表現，一眼就能看出整月的趨勢。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The shade shows how that day went, so the month’s trend is clear at a glance."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "色の濃淡がその日の状態を表すので、ひと月の傾向がひと目でわかります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "顏色深淺代表當天的表現，一眼就能看出整月的趨勢。"
